            <ArticleTitle>Two-Dimensional Conjugated Polymers Based on C-C Coupling.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>522-526</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1021/acs.accounts.6b00525</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The synthesis of a crystalline two-dimensional (2D) polymer linked by C-C bonds can be considered as one of the holy grails of synthetic chemistry. Possible routes may involve interface-confined polymerization at air-water or solid-solid interfaces or sterically constrained polymerization of prepacked crystalline monomers.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
